    "catch-up pieces do not share. The vendor hides soulbound gear another class cannot wear, so the priest",
    "shopper is shown 47 of each 131-piece list and all 60 Challenger's accessories. Every world spawn stands on the",
    "floor of Champion's Hall or the Hall of Legends, clear of the walls."
